+      "参数校验失败（工具 ask_user_question）:\n- questions.0.question: 期望 string，实际收到 undefined",
+      "toolu_01QcH2merrmxvKAWoLzMruwJ",
+    );
+    await hookSystem.fireSessionEndEvent("exit");
